# Checkpoint = Haltestelle (Austrian bus stop): round yellow disc Y/o with a
# green G rim and a bold green "H" on an iron pole i/m, timetable board
# below (d frame, b header bar, w/i timetable rows).
# active: the header turns red and a paper note ("auch voll") is taped on,
# its corner sticking out past the board.
sprite = checkpoint
size   = 16x32
origin = 8,32
hitbox = 6,0,4,32
anim   = idle   frames=1
anim   = active frames=1
